    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "★ Request\nFade to black",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "★ Request\nCostume: School uniform",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "(Running, chasing... running more, chasing further...\nThe more fulfilled my heart felt, the more it craved \"what was next.\")",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Wha...?! ",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...It just leaves me completely unfulfilled.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "(*wee-woo... wee-woo...*)",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Yeah!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I don't want to see the light go out right before my eyes anymore.\nAnd snuffing it out myself... is the last thing I want to do.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "(—Yes. Ever since that day.)",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I'm gonna win next time!\nSo, one more—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Kh!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Kh!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Word is Hishi Ama-san was the one who challenged her to this race!\nNo way she'd lose—ah! Hishi Ama-san made her move!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Big sis? Open your eyes.\nBig sis! Big sis!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I had heard the stories. That she ran in the Debut Selection Race,\nthe proving ground to scout horse girls, yet refused every single offer...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Some even said the moment anyone brought up debuting, she walked away immediately.\n...Could the answer to what burdens her lie there?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "A few days had passed since I witnessed Narita Brian's race.\nI tried approaching her multiple times, but—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "......",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Whoa, that person's here again. Talk about persistence.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Seriously persistent.\nDon't pay any more attention to them.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Ugh... my bad, Brian.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "(Back then, my sister's back was always ahead of me, refusing to let anyone pass.\nI chased it with everything I had. Because nothing brought me greater joy.)",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...The outcome is already decided. You know that no matter how\nmany times we run, the result won't change, don't you?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "............\n...Hmph...!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "—Come on! Brian!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Like hell I'm giving up just 'cause I lost once...!\nDon't you go acting like... you know everything about me...!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Where do you think you're going? This showdown isn't over yet.\nThis duel I challenged you to is best two out of three.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Then I'll spell it out. People like that\nput on a tough front once, but their fighting spirit has already gone stone cold.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hold it right there!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I've seen dozens just like them.\nRacing against people like that is a waste of time.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Khhh...... Daaamn it allllll!!\r\nUwoooooooooooooooooh!!!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Isn't that Trainer the most persistent one yet?\r\nShe'll probably just turn them down anyway, though. Just like after that debut exhibition race—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "......Dammit...! I know, alright...!!\r\nI know I can't beat you right now...!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...What about you?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "(—And so, that day came.)",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "(...I'm still parched.)",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Haa... haa...! \r\n...Khh!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "......",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "You're persistent.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "......",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "............",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hishiama-san's spirit is on another level today...!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I have nothing to say.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "(CRASHHHH!!)",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Draaaagh!!!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I will... beat you!!\r\nUraaaagh!!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "A few days later. I heard that Narita Brian was racing again.\r\nI rushed over to the track...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    }
  ],
  "no_wrap": true
}